  "live_records": {
    "q-20202": {
      "dom_id": "step-q20202",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14253197/assets/868b0274063a19084dac216568a9ed3cebedcc82d967ed6d89ce62f96d38c336.png)\n\nConsider the picture shown above. Find $|a|.$",
      "worked_solution": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14253197/assets/a051a9158e8147415b605fee37aef3ef4862281da1c2a0387fd40aa99bddee49.png)\n\nIn $△AHB$ we have $∠AHB={90}^{∘}$, $AH=20\\,\\text{mm}$ and $BH=25\\,\\text{mm}.$ So, the Pythagorean theorem gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\sqrt{A{H}^{2}+B{H}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{20}^{2}+{25}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1\\,025} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{41}\\,\\text{mm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
