    "q-118915": {
      "dom_id": "step-q118915",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14253197/assets/de4864b00e5b51431ef019a930c3980e33c0f47812c9ee09743934128a72644b.png)\n\nConsider the picture shown above. Find $|a|.$",
      "worked_solution": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14253197/assets/ab521b7fc8b594fa7a8a97cf1b2dc57884d50d7941f0e6f7f6d56d3179d3c7a3.png)\n\nIn $△AHB$ we have $∠AHB={90}^{∘}$, $AH=25\\,\\text{mm}$ and $BH=25\\,\\text{mm}.$ So, the Pythagorean theorem gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\sqrt{A{H}^{2}+B{H}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{25}^{2}+{25}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2\\cdot {25}^{2}} \\\\  & =25\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{mm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
